{
  "title": "The Hunters' Lodge",
  "subtitle": "Range path",
  "icon": "minecraft:bow",
  "group": "skills",
  "order": 7,
  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "lodge_oath",
      "title": "Bow and Oath",
      "text": [
        "Huntmistress Vance won't take a hunter who can't make their own gear. Craft a bow and a quiver's worth of arrows, then swear the lodge oath at the hunters' lodge on the hill west of Reece."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:bow",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:arrow",
          "count": 32
        },
        {
          "talk": "character",
          "character": "orla",
          "lines": [
            "A bow you made yourself. Good.",
            "The lodge has one oath. Never waste a kill.",
            "Take what you need, use what you take, and leave the rest to grow.",
            "Say it, and you're one of us."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:lead",
          "name": "Lodge Armband",
          "lore": [
            "Worn by hunters of the lodge."
          ]
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:arrow",
          "count": 16
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 50
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:bow"
    },
    {
      "id": "first_tracks",
      "title": "First Tracks",
      "after": [
        "lodge_oath"
      ],
      "text": [
        "A fletcher shows you how to follow hoof prints through the woods. Track a deer, and take venison and an antler."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "talk": "org",
          "org": "hunters",
          "lines": [
            "Hoof prints, see? Deep at the front, so it was walking, not running.",
            "Follow them quietly, keep downwind, and take only what you'll eat.",
            "Bring back the venison. The antler is for the lodge wall."
          ]
        },
        {
          "item": "naturalist:venison",
          "count": 2
        },
        {
          "drop": {
            "from": [
              "naturalist:deer"
            ],
            "chance": 0.4,
            "item": "naturalist:antler"
          }
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:leather",
          "count": 8
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 80
        }
      ],
      "icon": "naturalist:antler"
    },
    {
      "id": "target_practice",
      "title": "Bullseye",
      "after": [
        "lodge_oath"
      ],
      "text": [
        "At the lodge's range, put ten arrows into target blocks at longer and longer distances."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:target",
          "count": 3,
          "crafted": true,
          "title": "Make three target blocks"
        },
        {
          "checkmark": "I put ten arrows into the targets"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:arrow",
          "count": 32
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:iron_ingot",
          "count": 4
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 80
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:target"
    },
    {
      "id": "boar_trouble",
      "title": "Tusks in the Turnips",
      "after": [
        "first_tracks"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Wild boars are tearing up a village's fields. Hunt down the sounder before it ruins the harvest, and keep the bushmeat."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "structure": "#villages",
          "title": "Reach the troubled village"
        },
        {
          "kill": "naturalist:boar",
          "count": 4,
          "title": "Drive the sounder off the fields",
          "spawn": {
            "at": {
              "structure": "#villages"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "item": "naturalist:bushmeat",
          "count": 3
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "naturalist:cooked_bushmeat",
          "count": 8
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 120
        }
      ],
      "icon": "naturalist:bushmeat"
    },
    {
      "id": "throwing_steel",
      "title": "Thrown Steel",
      "after": [
        "target_practice"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Old Tobiah swears by thrown weapons, and by never whistling in a forest. Craft iron throwing knives, a tomahawk and javelins, and put them to use."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:iron_throwing_knife",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:iron_tomahawk",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:iron_javelin",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "kill": "minecraft:zombie",
          "count": 6,
          "title": "Make kills with your thrown steel"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:copper_boomerang"
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 150
        }
      ],
      "icon": "spartanweaponry:iron_throwing_knife"
    },
    {
      "id": "firewatch",
      "title": "The Lookout",
      "after": [
        "boar_trouble"
      ],
      "text": [
        "The lodge keeps a lookout in a firewatch tower deep in the forest. Climb it, meet the watcher and mark three game trails from the top."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "structure": "#firewatch_towers",
          "title": "Climb the firewatch tower"
        },
        {
          "encounter": {
            "entity": "minecraft:villager",
            "name": "Tower Watcher",
            "where": {
              "above_y": 60
            },
            "then": "talk",
            "lines": [
              "Welcome up! Mind the third rung, it's loose.",
              "See the trails? Deer to the east, boar by the stream, something big in the north.",
              "Mark them. The lodge will want the map."
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "checkmark": "I marked three game trails"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:spyglass"
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 150
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:spyglass"
    },
    {
      "id": "longbow",
      "title": "The Longbow",
      "after": [
        "firewatch"
      ],
      "text": [
        "From the tower, the watcher points out a deer far below. Craft a longbow and drop it with one shot from the top, before it wanders off."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:iron_longbow",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "structure": "#firewatch_towers"
        },
        {
          "timed": {
            "seconds": 180,
            "goal": {
              "kill": "naturalist:deer",
              "count": 1
            },
            "lines": [
              "There. Far below. You won't get long.",
              "One good shot."
            ],
            "start": "Take the shot",
            "no": [
              "teleport"
            ]
          },
          "title": "Drop the deer in three minutes"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:arrow",
          "count": 32
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:spectral_arrow",
          "count": 8
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 180
        }
      ],
      "icon": "spartanweaponry:iron_longbow"
    },
    {
      "id": "silent_camp",
      "title": "The Silent Camp",
      "after": [
        "firewatch"
      ],
      "text": [
        "A hunting party's camp has gone quiet. Find it, follow the claw marks and rescue the last hunter from the tree where a grizzly bear has kept him for two days."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "structure": "#camps",
          "title": "Find the silent camp"
        },
        {
          "encounter": {
            "entity": "alexsmobs:grizzly_bear",
            "name": "Camp Grizzly",
            "health": 60,
            "glow": true,
            "then": "kill",
            "lines": [
              "Grrrrr!"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "encounter": {
            "entity": "minecraft:villager",
            "name": "Stranded Hunter",
            "then": "talk",
            "lines": [
              "Is it gone? Is it really gone?",
              "Two days up this tree. Two days! Thank you, friend. Tell the lodge I'm alive."
            ]
          }
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "alexsmobs:bear_fur",
          "count": 2
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 220
        }
      ],
      "icon": "alexsmobs:bear_fur"
    },
    {
      "id": "odd_coats",
      "title": "Odd Coats",
      "after": [
        "throwing_steel"
      ],
      "text": [
        "The lodge collects strange pelts and bones. Bring down odd-looking zombies, spiders and skeletons with arrows, and bring proof of each."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "drop": {
            "from": [
              "minecraft:zombie"
            ],
            "chance": 0.15,
            "item": {
              "name": "Odd Hide",
              "tooltip": "Proof for the lodge",
              "texture": "minecraft:item/rotten_flesh"
            }
          },
          "consume": false
        },
        {
          "drop": {
            "from": [
              "minecraft:spider"
            ],
            "chance": 0.15,
            "item": {
              "name": "Odd Fang",
              "tooltip": "Proof for the lodge",
              "texture": "minecraft:item/spider_eye"
            }
          },
          "consume": false
        },
        {
          "drop": {
            "from": [
              "minecraft:skeleton"
            ],
            "chance": 0.15,
            "item": {
              "name": "Odd Bone",
              "tooltip": "Proof for the lodge",
              "texture": "minecraft:item/bone"
            }
          },
          "consume": false
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "minecraft:spectral_arrow",
          "count": 16
        },
        {
          "item": "minecraft:arrow",
          "count": 32
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 200
        }
      ],
      "icon": "minecraft:spider_eye"
    },
    {
      "id": "heavy_crossbow",
      "title": "Bolts at Night",
      "after": [
        "odd_coats",
        "main_story:act1_start"
      ],
      "text": [
        "Some nights call for a heavier weapon. Craft a heavy crossbow and bolts and drop twenty skeletons before dawn."
      ],
      "tasks": [
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:iron_heavy_crossbow",
          "crafted": true
        },
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:bolt",
          "count": 32
        },
        {
          "kill": "minecraft:skeleton",
          "count": 20,
          "title": "Hold the night: drop twenty skeletons"
        }
      ],
      "rewards": [
        {
          "item": "spartanweaponry:bolt",
          "count": 32
        },
        {
          "skill": "range",
          "xp": 280
        }
      ],
      "icon": "spartanweaponry:iron_heavy_crossbow"
    }
  ]
}
